<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "9O">
<servcat sctnbr = "09" scnbr = "15">
<configtype typenbr = "0">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0C9F06007" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
GPS Antenna Removal and Installation (If Equipped)
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9F06007001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove instrument panel center ornament. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9306001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove navigation unit. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9F06001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove steering column hole cover, instrument panel driver outside garnish and instrument panel driver inside garnish and then remove combination meter cluster panel and combination meter. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C9306001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove instrument panel upper garnish.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Non-A/C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C7216010"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Manual A/C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C7226024"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Auto A/C model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0C7236035"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove screw (1) and then remove GPS antenna (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A9F0013.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "61.033mm" ver = "01" gw = "214" gh = "156"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0C9F06007002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure.
</ptxt>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
